menuList[1].Text = ...;
renderer.DisplayStatus? no; menu visible.
```
- Persist immediately: `AppSettings.Current.Save();` every change. But Save calls `JsonSerializer.Serialize(this)` from main; okay.
- `AudioMuted` persists.
- When starting, `AppSettings.Current.AudioVolume` maybe 0 from old? default. Normalize.
- `AppSettings.Normalize`: add `AudioVolume = Math.Clamp(AudioVolume, 0, 100);`. Note if missing property default 80. Good.
- Could save after `AppSettings.Current.AudioVolume` changed from menu. yes.
- Where to apply initial settings? `EmuWin` has `machine` after constructor, before `renderer` maybe. Add:
