 Assert.True(halfPeak < fullPeak);
 Assert.InRange(halfPeak, fullPeak*0.4, fullPeak*0.6) maybe exact linear; rounding. Use `Assert.InRange((double)halfPeak/fullPeak, 0.45,0.55)`. But output envelope/phase same, deterministic. Good.
