### CRT support design

CRT format:
- 16-byte header: `"C64 CARTRIDGE   "` (16 bytes), header length 0x40, version, hardware type, EXROM, GAME, reserved, name (32 bytes), then chips.
- Chip header 16: `"CHIP"`, packet length (4), chip type (2), bank (2), load address (2), image size (2), data.
- Standard 8K/16K cartridges: hardware type 0, EXROM/GAME config (0=8K, 1=16K, etc); chip types ROM (0), RAM (1), FLASH (2).
